{"id":"n23741-1-7","stage":4,"title":"기약 · 约定","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23741-1-7-1","ko":"우리는 이제 후일을 기약을 합시다.","zh":"我们改天再约吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리는","audio":"/audio/6cae49a92f8e0e0e2ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"후일을","meaning":"日后，今后，以后","explanation":"후일：日后，今后，以后；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"후일","audio":"/audio/76afc931d960e2ed19ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87528","senseId":"1","lemma":"후일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후일을","audio":"/audio/cdca87bc6ff873493890.mp3"}},{"text":"기약을","meaning":"约定，相约","explanation":"기약：约定，相约；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기약","audio":"/audio/67ad9773cf306da3593c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23741","senseId":"1","lemma":"기약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기약을","audio":"/audio/fa0b15efbd8b10870fdf.mp3"}},{"text":"합시다.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합시다","audio":"/audio/326e38db3a1c5c039642.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"76afc931d960e2ed","term":"후일","zh":"日后，今后，以后","audio":"/audio/76afc931d960e2ed19ba.mp3","entryId":"87528","definition":"时间流逝后的将来某天。","pronunciation":["후ː일"]},{"id":"67ad9773cf306da3","term":"기약","zh":"约定，相约","audio":"/audio/67ad9773cf306da3593c.mp3","entryId":"23741","definition":"定下时间并许下诺言；或指那种诺言。","pronunciation":["기약"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e170280ba45f8be48eca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23741-1-7-2","ko":"네. 시간이 늦었으니 다음 모임 때 만나요.","zh":"好的。时间不早了，下次聚会时见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었으니","meaning":"缓慢，晚","explanation":"늦다：缓慢，晚；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"2","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었으니","audio":"/audio/84b62e02aacfbe921ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term"